{
  "_doc": "cavalry (horse + rider, bases/cavalry.py): 27 columns at 192x224. Gaits and every multi-frame anim use shared_fit (one translation per direction) so the horse does not slide between frames. gallop = fast travel; charge = gallop with the sabre forward.",
